  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g495037-d1483551-r1052394620-Discovery_Parks_Robe-Robe_South_Australia.html",
  "title": "Rundown Discovery Park!",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Very rundown park that needs serious money spent on it. \nWe stayed in a caravan site that had power failures. This was a known issue as several staff members told us but nothing is being done to rectify this issue. Just told turn off all unnecessary power to conserve electricity! Not good enough when we were paying to stay otherwise we would have chosen to free camp somewhere else. \nNo sullage also which I found incredible in a park within a township and certainly not environmental. \nPool area was run down and not at all inviting. The water was cold even though it is advertised as being heated. Not enough toilet and shower cubicles for the amount of guests. Overall we would not recommend this park and would think seriously of staying in a discovery park again.",
  "username": "diannefmelbourne",
  "connectionToSubject": null,
  "absoluteUrl": "https://www.tripadvisor.com/ShowUserReviews-g495037-d1483551-r1052394620-Discovery_Parks_Robe-Robe_South_Australia.html",
