  "title": "Disgusted my grandchildren’s Christmas ruined",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Absolutely disgraceful we booked this caravan park in February for a holiday this Christmas period.  We received a call today 22/11/24 to advise that our vans were too big for their sites and our bookings would be cancelled.  I read a review on Facebook about some other people that booked in April and were advised in September that their bookings were cancelled due to their vans being too big as well.  Hopefully they were able to book elsewhere, we have no hope.  I tried phoning their head office left a message and no return call.  Merry Christmas discovery parks.",
