  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g495037-d1483551-r954608396-Discovery_Parks_Robe-Robe_South_Australia.html",
  "title": "Amazing place to stay",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "We very rarely stay at parks as our kids are feral and we like privacy for that reason haha\n\nBut this place has completely changed our view, staff were amazing and so friendly, they put on so much fun stuff for the kids too, pancakes on the weekends, they hide a lobster in the park for the kids to find, cfs put on a big fire on the Saturday night, quiz for the adults to win wine, \n\nIt was going to be a dad and kids weekend, my wife and eldest daughter decided to tag along; went in to pay the extra on arrival and the manager said don’t worry about it, then we decided to stay an extra night and they charged it out at half price, \n\nOn top of the park robe is a lovely town with lovely people and so so much to do, we did a heap of fishing, 4wding, exploring near by towns, pub meals, we will definitely be returning soon Thankyou so much Robe discovery park",
  "username": "Pioneer230101",
