    "language": "en",
    "text": "G'day Glenis Z, thanks for staying with us at Discovery Parks - Robe and taking the time to leave your kind words. We're thrilled to read you loved your time with us and especially enjoyed our awesome cabin. It's great to have everything you need in one spot when holidaying. We are sorry there were dogs off lead during your stay, please let us know next time so we can address this at the time, the Park Rules are Dogs are to be on leads at all times. We hope to welcome you back to our park soon. Kind Regards, the Discovery Parks - Robe team.",
