  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g495037-d1483551-r911605038-Discovery_Parks_Robe-Robe_South_Australia.html",
  "title": "A most comfortable place to stay.",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "We stayed in a most comfortable delux cabin. It had all been clean and prepared for us. There was everything you needed in the kiichen for cookung any meals, plus plenty of cutlery . The cleanbathroom was fitted with many clean towels plus heating and fans. The beds were very comfortable. There was more than enough cupboard space for our clothes. Heating was just right for this colder month,  Highly recommended",
