    "translationType": null,
    "publishedDate": "2023-03-01",
    "language": "en",
    "text": "G'day Paul, thanks for taking the time to provide your feedback. We're happy to know you liked your time with us at Discovery Parks - Robe but are sorry you found our site to be a little tight. If you need any assistance in future, please be sure to chat with one of our friendly staff members so we can give you a hand. We're glad this didn't deter your stay and hope we can welcome you back again soon! Kind Regards, the Discovery Parks - Robe team.",
