  "url": "/ShowUserReviews-g495037-d1483551-r880237848-Discovery_Parks_Robe-Robe_South_Australia.html",
  "title": "Location, location,location",
  "language": "en",
  "originalLanguage": "en",
  "roomTip": null,
  "text": "Well this has a proviso to it. The park is in a fantastic location right on the beach and with great views. It is very tidy and the amenities are excellent and clean ( could have better pressure with the hot water) . The people are very friendly and helpful and are unobtrusive except for the hissing truck when it backs! \nThe proviso? Well we found many of the sites small and with people having to park their car in front of their van reversing your van in was hard. You may need help.  Many parks are like this and they are a hangover from the days when people towed a 10 ft van with an FB Holden. The van next to us took up the whole length of the site bar for about half a meter at the back. Still being aware of the site limitations you can decide but I would recommend this park.",
  "username": "PaulP299",
  "connectionToSubject": null,
